"month appears on the left, with the month's appointments arranged by day in "
"an overview on the right.</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 430 210' width='430' "
"height='210'><rect x='4' y='4' width='422' height='202' fill='#f6efdc' "
"stroke='#ab9468'/><text x='16' y='24' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-"
"size='15' fill='#3a3128'>July 2026</text><line x1='12' y1='32' x2='418' "
"y2='32' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-width='2'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-"
"size='8' fill='#93805d'><text x='30' y='46'>MON</text><text x='84' "
